{"params": [
  {"id": "mix.clipDrive", "group": "Drop power", "label": "Master clipper drive", "short": "Clip", "unit": "dB", "scale": "lin", "min": 0, "max": 18, "set": 0, "sketch": "master.clipDrive@real", "note": "The phone's soft clipper on the master. Offline (batch 5) 8.9 dB of soft clip with 36% parallel compression made the peak denser (the references' block crest is 4.4-6.6 dB, the set's 8.7). Not a knob in the set: the Main has no clipper."},
